		"meta": {
			"author": "Stefan Mazur",
			"category": "effect",
			"deploymentTarget": {
				"branch": "",
				"name": "Wire",
				"version": {
					"major": 7,
					"minor": 29,
					"patch": 0
				}
			},
			"description": "Motion Bridge - Autumn Wind: leaves, maple seeds, chestnuts, twigs and feathers drift in the wind, over the screen with depth or over the floor in perspective. Motion stirs them up; blown against something standing still they stick to it and gather there; motion stirs them off again. On the screen the field is read as seen from the front: x along the front, the distance from the surface as the item's depth, so motion near the surface stirs near items and far away the far ones (issue #70). Driven by the Motion Bridge field (Spout); calm without the bridge; transparent background. Needs the Motion Bridge tool. In Arena, load the Spout source 'Motion Bridge' as a clip at its own size, set the layer's Auto Size to Stretch, put this patch on the clip (after its Transform) and set the layer's blend mode to Alpha. Runs in real time. Scale sizes everything relative to the output height. Physics: Wind Strength, Wind Direction (where it blows to; 0 = right), Fall Strength, Fall Direction (270 = down), Gust Sway, Tumble, Speed Variation, Eddies, Eddy Size, Stir Strength (how hard motion stirs them up), Stick Strength (how fast they stick to what stands still). Items: Item Plane (Screen = with depth, Floor = over the floor in perspective), Performance Cap, Item Size, Depth Spread, Depth Haze, Color Variation, Variation Color. Autumn: Leaf, Maple Seed, Chestnut, Twig, Feather, each with Density (per output height squared) and Color. View: Horizon Y. Field: Field Plane, Field X, Field Y, Field Width, Field Height, Field Rotation (on the floor as in Motion Bridge - Fabric Wind; on the screen Field X and Field Width place the front, Field Height is the share of the field's depth that the items' depths cover), Shadow Hold. Show Field shows the field as the items see it: red occupancy, green motion, blue held shadow. Shader: Resource/AutumnWind.fs.",
			"displayName": "Motion Bridge - Autumn Wind",
			"identifier": "b2c7e1f4-6a3d-4e8b-9c51-2f0a7d4e6b13",
			"licenseName": "Unlicense",
			"mail": "S.Mazur@cati-co.de",
